  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A framework for enhancing quality assurance in GGGI&#x2019;s Adaptation and Resilience projects</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="4">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Active</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAID, IEU, and the Resilience CoP will collaborate to study GGGI&apos;s results monitoring for adaptation and resilience projects in comparison to global best practices and the interests of our member countries. The study will produce a guidance framework/toolkit for quality-assuring GGGI&apos;s A&amp;R projects globally. The project will be conducted in collaboration with King&apos;s College London as part of Michael Bak&apos;s proposed joint DPhil program between GGGI and King&apos;s, enhancing the quality and legitimacy of the framework to donors and partners.</narrative>
  </description>
